<%= @imprecise_source_time ? "Newly received diagnostic" : "New error" %> in <%= @project.name %>

<% if @imprecise_source_time %>Logister newly received evidence for this error type. Its source does not provide an exact occurrence time, so this does not claim the error first occurred now.
<% else %>This is the first evidence Logister has received for this error type in your project.
<% end %>

Error: <%= @group.title %>
<% if @group.subtitle.present? %>Class: <%= @group.subtitle %>
<% end %>Environment: <%= @group.stage %>
Severity: <%= @group.severity %>
<% if @group.introduced_in_release.present? %>Release: <%= @group.introduced_in_release %>
<% end %><% if @evidence.reporting_interval? %>Reporting period: <%= [@evidence.reporting_start, @evidence.reporting_end].compact.map { |time| l(time, format: :long) }.join(" – ") %>
<% elsif @evidence.exact_time? %>Occurred: <%= l(@evidence.occurred_at, format: :long) %>
<% elsif @group.first_seen_at %>First observed: <%= l(@group.first_seen_at, format: :long) %>
<% end %><% if @evidence.received_at %>Received: <%= l(@evidence.received_at, format: :long) %>
<% end %>
Open error:
<%= @group_url %>

Manage project email settings:
<%= @settings_url %>
